{* Unified highlight of a file number (spisovka): a primary-tinted chip with
   a border. The font intentionally inherits from the surroundings (no mono,
   no size change) and the padding is em-based so the chip scales from H1
   headings down to small muted lines. When the chip is a link, wrap it in
   <a class="link-hover"> - the text is already primary-colored, the hover
   underline adds the affordance.
   Usage: {include spisovka from '../@spisovka.latte', label: $label} *}

{define spisovka, string $label}
    <span class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-[0.4em] border border-primary/40 bg-primary/10 px-[0.35em] py-[0.1em] text-primary">{$label}</span>
{/define}
